### Step 3 — 2FA, trusted devices, password reset. VS Code "REST Client", run top to bottom.
### Emails (codes, reset links) are printed in the app console in dev.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Sign up a fresh user
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "otp_chef", "email": "otp_chef@cookify.dev", "password": "Cookify2026!", "confirmPassword": "Cookify2026!" }

### 2. Enable 2FA (wrong password → 400 INVALID_PASSWORD)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/two-factor
Authorization: Bearer {{signup.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true, "password": "Cookify2026!" }

### 3. Login → 200 { twoFactorRequired: true, challengeId, maskedEmail }. Check console for the 6-digit code.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "otp_chef", "password": "Cookify2026!" }

### 4. Verify code → 200 tokens + cookify_refresh + cookify_device cookies. Replace 123456 with the console code.
# @name verify
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "{{login.response.body.challengeId}}", "code": "123456", "rememberDevice": true }

### 5. Login again from this "device" → tokens directly, no code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "otp_chef", "password": "Cookify2026!" }

### 6. List remembered devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{verify.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Forgot password → 202. Reset link printed in console.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "otp_chef@cookify.dev" }

### 8. Reset password → 204. Paste the token from the console link.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE", "password": "NewCookify2026!", "confirmPassword": "NewCookify2026!" }

### 9. Old password now fails → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "otp_chef", "password": "Cookify2026!" }
